  "implementation": [
    "Store::try_native_media_read_under derives the exact target/source current facts using an active NativeMediaRead only as file-fence custody. It first requires a current reader belonging to the exact Store namespace and runtime owner.",
    "The current complete scope set must be covered. Foreign, insufficient or expired custody refuses without fresh admission fallback. The shared fence lets a bounded composition finish behind a queued writer while preserving that writer until the last reader drops.",
    "Current SQL Connection/data_version/schema_version/total_changes/policy-second metadata validation and final version sealing remain. The holder supplies no recipient permission, credential, audience or binding. Target/source physical credentials, current subscription permission, membership epochs, generations, recipient ceilings and retirement are still derived for that exact pair.",
    "The returned expiry is bounded by both current pair facts and the holder expiry. SQL ends before return. This API performs no media IO; its trusted caller must preserve the original packet200ms age, cancellation and actual route/subscription guards. Ordinary try_native_media_read keeps independent fresh admission.",
    "Core and Service do not yet call this new composition API. No queued grant or runtime behavior is changed by this component alone."
